Create the file `/Users/steve.briggs/projects/operations/terraform/iac-library/aws/storage/database-tools-db/output.tf` with this exact content:

```hcl
output "address" {
  value = module.database.address
}

output "admin_password" {
  sensitive = true
  value     = module.database.admin_password
}

output "admin_password_secret_arn" {
